                new GraphVoteRequest(voteReq, "REJECT")), HttpStatus.CONFLICT);
    }

    @Test
    void vote_multiRolePerson_singleVoteSatisfiesAllSeats() {
        // alice 同时是两个受影响事件的指挥官，且兼任安全审核员：一人一票满足全部席位
        commanding("INC-A", "alice");
